# Modules that are not part of the Stage 1-6 pipeline.
#
# Each of these was a real step at the time it was written, and each was
# superseded. None is imported by any pipeline module, and none is invoked by
# any pipeline stage -- verified by import graph, not by reading docstrings.
# The only surviving references to them are comments and docstrings.
#
# All six were untracked with `git rm --cached` on 2026-07-30 -- .gitignore
# has no effect on a tracked file, so listing them here alone would have done
# nothing. They remain on disk and their content remains in history at the
# commits that introduced them; only the index entry is gone.
#
# To restore one to the index, delete its line below and:
#
#     git add -f <name>
#
# Deleting the working-tree copies is a separate decision and has not been
# made -- see the retired-in-place convention in UPDATES.md.

# --- Stage 2 exploratory crop work, all frame-0 only ----------------------
# Superseded by build_id_images.py (Stage 3), which does the same geometry
# across all 2000 frames in one composed warp.

# "the minimal first step" -- axis-aligned boxes, no masking, no rescaling.
make_boxes.py

# "practice run" -- canonical-frame hull images. The sizing statistics it
# worked out (median x-spread, mean y-length, median centroid height) live on
# in config.py; the module itself does not.
canonical_hulls.py

# Stage 2 proper. UPDATES.md: "PLUMBING WORKS, IMAGE QUALITY DOES NOT". Its
# own docstring flags pad=0 and dilate_iters=0 as placeholders -- "do not
# build on these". Nothing does.
crops.py

# --- Stage 5, retired in place --------------------------------------------
# Carries a "SLEAP-PORT: RETIRED -- NOT PART OF THE PIPELINE" banner and has
# its __main__ commented out so it cannot be run as a stage by accident. The
# readout is now the SLEAP GUI via build_sleap_tracks.py (Stage 6); nothing
# consumes idtracker.ai's trajectories/ folder.
build_trajectories.py

# --- Reports on the retired modules ---------------------------------------
# Frame-0 measurements describing crops.py and episodes.py as they stood in
# Stage 1-2. UPDATES.md is the current record.
_report_crops.md
_report_episodes.md


# ===========================================================================
# Standalone-repo rules. This directory is now the repository root, so it
# carries the rules the old parent root used to provide.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Reference forks ------------------------------------------------------
# ~428 MB of unmodified upstream source, imported by nothing, kept only to read
# the port against. Fully reproducible -- see PROVENANCE.md.
vendor/

# --- Experiment data ------------------------------------------------------
# Not code. Point SLEAP_IDTRACKER_DATA at wherever yours lives; `data/` is the
# default location and stays out of history at any size.
data/
*.mp4
*.slp
*.pkg.slp
*.zip

# --- Pipeline output ------------------------------------------------------
# Written by the stages, reproducible by re-running them.
session_*/
crops/
crops_frame0*/
trajectories/
*.log

# --- Model checkpoints ----------------------------------------------------
# Reproducible by retraining, and past GitHub's 50 MB warning. Git cannot
# delta-compress them, so every version would be kept forever at full size.
*.ckpt
wandb/
*.n=[0-9]*/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# --- macOS ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
